  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Gan Ni of Longevity Heaven kneels before Immortal Zombie Giant Sun and hands over four rank eight Immortal Gu. Giant Sun takes one and observes it.",
        "chapters": [
          2151
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_earth_extremity",
          "fac_longevity_heaven",
          "char_immortal_zombie_giant_sun",
          "sys_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When Thieving Heaven’s true inheritance space appears, Immortal Zombie Giant Sun recalls that he moved in advance to dismantle a portion of the true inheritance and obtained the killer move perfect pair and imitation Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          2172
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "thieving-heaven-inheritance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "inh_thieving_heaven_true_inheritance"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "That Thieving Heaven true inheritance contained imitation Gu and the killer move perfect pair originally, but Fang Yuan only obtained the rest. The remaining portion concerns refinement path, including how Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable created fake Immortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          2178
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-remainder",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "char_thieving_heaven_demon_venerable"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "During Giant Sun Immortal Venerable’s revival in Crazed Demon Cave, countless Gu worms form a killer move that draws in blood path divine power from Longevity Heaven. Familial emotion Gu is the first core. Next to it is imitation Gu, already transformed into blood relation Gu, which is the second core.",
        "chapters": [
          2203
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "blood-relation-form",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_crazed_demon_cave",
          "sys_gu_worms",
          "gu_familial_emotion_gu",
          "gu_blood_relation_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After reviving, Giant Sun Immortal Venerable lacks blood relation Immortal Gu among other blood path Immortal Gu already owned in the world. Without an alternative, he had to temporarily turn imitation Gu into blood relation Gu and barely created a blood path formation that helped him revive during the battle in Crazed Demon Cave.",
        "chapters": [
          2246
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "revival-formation",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
